# Build artifacts (output of `go build`)
/keepass-deltasync
/keepass-deltasync.exe
/cmd/keepass-deltasync/keepass-deltasync
/cmd/keepass-deltasync/keepass-deltasync.exe

# Windows only: when the target .exe is locked — the binary is running, or a
# virus scanner still holds it — the Go linker cannot overwrite it, so it
# renames the old one out of the way with a trailing tilde and writes a fresh
# .exe. The leftover is a full 13 MB binary that the rules above do not match.
/keepass-deltasync.exe~
/cmd/keepass-deltasync/keepass-deltasync.exe~
